{"out": "../../../output/nice-ignored-draft/part4.mp4", "audio": "p4.wav", "speed": 1.0, "tail": 0.45, "music_fade": 0.5, "music_cues": [{"shot": 0, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/echoes.mp3", "start": 140.0}, {"shot": 11, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/unforgiven.mp3", "start": 90.0}], "music_volume": 0.33, "style": {"grade": "film", "captions": "karaoke", "caption_y": 0.86, "vignette": 0.36, "grain": 6}, "shots": [{"text": "The second thing I learned is about value.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/coins-4.mp4", "start": 1.0, "zoom": 1.08}}, {"text": "When everything is a yes, your yes stops meaning anything.", "v": {"mg": "stamps", "times": [0.1, 0.35, 0.6, "@yes", "@stops-0.3", "@stops"], "word": "YES", "label": "YOUR YES MEANS NOTHING", "label_at": "@meaning"}, "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "bass", "at": 0.1, "gain": 0.35}, {"name": "bass", "at": 0.35, "gain": 0.35}, {"name": "bass", "at": 0.6, "gain": 0.35}], "in": "wipe", "captions": false}, {"text": "Think about it.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["THINK ABOUT IT.", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0]}, "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "If someone always agrees with you, their agreement doesn't feel special.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-mirror-people.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0}, "in": "flash", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "If someone is always available, their time doesn't feel valuable.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-phone-2am.jpg", "focus": [0.45, 0.45], "zoom": 1.4}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "If someone praises everything you do, their praise becomes background noise.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-coins.jpg", "focus": [0.55, 0.6], "zoom": 1.0, "to": [0.43, 0.5], "to_zoom": 1.6, "drift": 0}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "I used to compliment everyone, all the time.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-compliment.jpg", "focus": [0.4, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0}, "pause_before": 0.25, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "I thought it made people feel good.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/office-meeting-1.mp4", "start": 6.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "But a friend once told me, \"When you say something's great, I never know if you mean it.\"", "v": {"mg": "quote", "text": "\"When you say something's great, I never know if you mean it.\"", "end": "@mean", "width": 30}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "That stung. Because she was right.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-compliment.jpg", "focus": [0.67, 0.4], "zoom": 1.7}, "in": "flash", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "I'd given away so many compliments that they'd lost their value.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-coins.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.55], "zoom": 1.1}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "The people who get attention are often the people whose approval feels earned.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/confident-walk-1.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "Not because they're cold, but because their yes is real.", "v": {"mg": "versus", "left": ["NOT", "COLD"], "right": ["JUST", "REAL"], "at": "@real", "left_at": 0.0}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "When they say \"That's brilliant,\" you know they mean it.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/friends-pizza-2.mp4", "start": 5.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "flash", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "So start being honest with your praise. Save it for the things you really mean.", "v": {"mg": "marker", "lines": ["SAVE YOUR PRAISE", "FOR WHAT", "YOU MEAN"], "mark": ["YOU MEAN"], "times": [0.0, "@things", "@really"]}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "You'll be amazed how much more weight your words carry when they're not handed out like free samples.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-coins.jpg", "focus": [0.43, 0.45], "zoom": 1.8}, "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "sparkle", "at": "@weight"}], "in": "flash"}]}